          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-500/20 text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-300 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">
            Planned & Prioritized
